Austin Butler's performance had this critic all shook up.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.968
And I, for one, smell a hunk of, hunk of

00:04:35.968 --> 00:04:37.534
burning up the box office.

00:04:37.534 --> 00:04:39.601
Should you see it? I Holly would.

00:04:39.601 --> 00:04:41.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:41.901 --> 00:04:44.033
"Jurassic World: Dominion."

00:04:44.033 --> 00:04:46.968
No, not "da Minions," those little yellow scamps.

00:04:46.968 --> 00:04:49.133
But there's plenty of mischief in this world,

00:04:49.133 --> 00:04:52.067
