00:04:52.067 --> 00:04:54.400
Should man play God? Probably not.

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:56.467
Should you see it? I Holly would.

00:04:56.467 --> 00:04:59.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:59.033 --> 00:05:00.801
"Top Gun: Maverick."

00:05:00.801 --> 00:05:02.901
Tom Cruise may be leavin' on a jet plane,

00:05:02.901 --> 00:05:05.267
but it's audiences who'll be back again and again

00:05:05.267 --> 00:05:07.834
to see the sequel with all the right stuff.

00:05:07.834 --> 00:05:11.434
Top Gun? More like top-notch entertainment.

00:05:11.434 --> 00:05:14.234
Permission to be thrilled? Aye-aye Holly would.

00:05:14.234 --> 00:05:17.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:17.033 --> 00:05:18.901
"The Bad Guys."

00:05:18.901 --> 00:05:21.367
More like "The Great Family Film."

00:05:21.367 --> 00:05:24.701
This movie's filled with heart, laughs, and style to spare.

00:05:24.701 --> 00:05:28.701
To quote another "bad guy," duh, Billy I Holly would.

00:05:28.701 --> 00:05:32.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:32.634 --> 00:05:33.868
"Morbius."

00:05:33.868 --> 00:05:35.234
♪ Morb, morb, morb ♪

00:05:35.234 --> 00:05:36.934
♪ How do you like it, how do you like it? ♪

00:05:36.934 --> 00:05:39.601
I love this tale of the Dracula doctor

00:05:39.601 --> 00:05:43.601
with the heart of an Oscar gold.

00:05:43.601 --> 00:05:46.434
Should you see it? Your call. I'm not your boss.

00:05:46.434 --> 00:05:48.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:48.434 --> 00:05:51.033
Oh. [ Laughs ]

00:05:51.033 --> 00:05:52.834
Well, the corn...

00:05:52.834 --> 00:05:54.934
[ Laughter ]

